  maxHealth: 110
  contactDamage: 1
  scoreReward: 2000
  description: A minor lord with a major opinion of himself, raising a chalice to
    his own health. It is not his blood, and it is not his health either.
  tactics: 'The first guarded Boss: his bar is GREY and he cannot be hurt while either
    Squire lives - do not waste a single arrow on him early. Drop both Squires (each
    pays out a powerup), watch him rage as the bar lights violet, then duel him honestly:
    aimed triples first, wide fans and rings below half. He hits harder than he deserves
    to.'
  displayName: The Baron
